Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: 0dc6ddbc421bacf417a2fee85a89fba33c2fc64c5b55ede40fdd360b5bfb7615
One unbranded running shoe pair taken out of a tidy cupboard into a stripe of morning light; all the other planned equipment stays on the shelf. First small habit. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
